Comment: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(957,787.5)}Earth in Danger Record of Our War Against
Comment: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(949.5,877.5)}the Aliens Official Government Material {\fad(450,650)}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:42.01,Announcement,,0,0,0,,The Garmillas fighter will be launching shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.01,0:21:44.80,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Guidance crew is to prepare for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:45.59,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat, guidance crew is to prepare for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.59,0:21:48.59,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat, guidance crew is to prepare for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Rear Brigadier Berger, 7th Strike Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy is seventy percent eliminated. They're turning tail and running.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gatlantis are nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate our foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.73,0:03:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The 7th Strike Group is to destroy the remaining hostiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar Balk!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Berger is getting cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.49,0:03:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But this will keep them off our backs for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to miss the fun, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,General Domel, message from Imperial Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,From Baleras? Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.63,0:03:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Ditz, Supreme Commander of Astrofleets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You look well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am pleased to see that you also do, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Domel, you have been ordered to return to the home world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.65,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You are to be awarded the Desler Cross, Special First Class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm honored, sir. But this is the\Nlynchpin of the empire's defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As commanding officer, I cannot leave the front lines for any such reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand. This is a political performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But His Lordship has some idea in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sent the 8th Army as reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And Gudell's Gross Space Armored Forces are on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll see you at Baleras.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar Balk!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get dressed, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Their DNA is arranged just like ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.47,0:05:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. She's the same as us. Except for her skin color.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, we should be able to get more useful information out of Melda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can think of many ways to question her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we should let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Her ship has no warp drive. Interstellar flight is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll end up killing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just keep her locked up. She helped us escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In a way, she's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,One of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of people on board have lost family to the Garmillans!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we consider their feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother died fighting them. I hate them as much as anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One reason to lock her up is to protect her from those feelings getting out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No one on this ship would do anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words are lacking in logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than lacking in humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.09,0:06:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My decision remains unchanged.\NI'll leave her questioning to you, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you believe what that Garmillan woman said?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That we attacked first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you survive first contact, Yama? That wasn't what happened, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a stupid lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my... The whole ship is talking about what that Garmillan said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:07:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yabu! Didn't you have to see Ms. Niimi for counseling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I'll be leaving early, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling uncertain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The date is April 1, 2191.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,An observation station on Uranus captures video of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,spaceships from another civilization entering the Solar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The UN Cosmo Force immediately gathers the inner planet fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The first defensive actions in our history against an enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,from outside the Solar System are ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Twenty-seven Japanese battleships participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8} The fleet commander is Admiral Juzo Okita,\Nfamous for his actions
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.32,0:07:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}during the Second Inner Planet War.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The first ship to encounter them in orbit\Nnear Pluto is Japanese cruiser Murasame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father isn't going to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we can be friends with the aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, hold on to hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But without warning, the aliens\Nopen fire on the Murasame, destroying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,With the exception of one crew member who is rescued,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Captain Daigo Shima and all crew perish, becoming the first casualties in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.26,0:08:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.22,0:08:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They fired first! Cowardly... Sneaky...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Without hesitating at the thought of destroying humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Garmillans are demons with human faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:09:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To me and to Kodai, they are enemies we can never forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We must stand against a greater threat than any we have ever known!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father was a great man. I can swear to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We must never forgive these demonic invaders from outer space!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been asked to interrogate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that. Let's see what he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, your shift isn't for another three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower Storm Leader Melda Ditz, serial number 3817529.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the same mentality we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The war movies I used to watch always had scenes like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what a movie is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any treaties on POW treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you surrender to us, you will be treated fairly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you refuse, you will be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.23,0:10:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you tried to destroy Earth? Is that your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were able to work together. That's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't break our promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor do we.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have the feeling you and I can trust each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the XO will say I'm not being logical again, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.34,0:10:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this an interrogation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to build trust first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he doesn't get any closer than he needs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tactical Officer is a man, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sharing trust with an alien is a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.57,0:11:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,After leaving the Milky Way, we'll be heading to Balun,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the midpoint between the Large Magellanic Cloud and us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lighthouse in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation Officer, did Yamato Plan HQ name it Balun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm told the name was in the plans Yurisha gave us a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation Officer, may I have a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.38,0:11:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind exercising.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But trying too hard isn't good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're taking it too personal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go cheer up some?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you want to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.95,0:12:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on board the ship your father captained.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Command issued a gag order to me regarding what I'd like to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I'm going to violate that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We attempted peaceful contact.\NBut they attacked us nevertheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The UN Space Defense Committee took this as an act of aggression against Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:13:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and it issued an emergency order...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire, Okita!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is humanity's first contact with\Nanother civilization. This is too hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we do nothing and it's too late? This is Central Command's decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Message from the Murasame, in the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.25,0:13:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"We have encountered the alien ship. Requesting orders."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears there's no point in discussing things further.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okita, by my authority as Military Director, I hereby remove you from command!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Serizawa from Central Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Murasame is to open fire on the alien vessel immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But Admiral Okita...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Has been removed from command!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And so we opened fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Deck 4 has been hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:13:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Critical damage! Second main gun is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Main engine output reduced by eighty percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew, abandon ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship is finished. Engine Officer,\Nhead below and manage the evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship with the aliens is possible. I told my son that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And instead, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go quickly! That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew, abandon ship! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency. Sealing airtight bulkheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.64,0:15:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Daisuke, hold on to hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember what happened next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or how I escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle had already ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.59,0:15:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And there was no sign of the comrades I'd thought had escaped with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie! You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you learn anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a person to whom honor means a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.03,0:15:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to learn any more from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:16:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who close their eyes to the past become blind to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you enjoy insulting my father's honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain was a great man. That's why I wanted you to{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept it! I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't this feel great?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you meant by "cheer up"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, after exercise, you stretch and\Nhave a bath. Everyone knows that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.91,0:16:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I hear about you all the time, I expected you to be more guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.33,0:16:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,About before...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it that I'm taking too personal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it seem that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.39,0:17:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you lost your brother fighting the Garmillans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But it isn't fair to direct your anger toward her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever lose family in a war, you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That might be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My only memories are from this past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose my family is all dead, but I can't remember what they were like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I don't think you could understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Our investigation has revealed a high probability that there is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,an enemy outpost in this star system that we'll pass through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already decided a route around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we will maintain course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And we will release Lower Storm Leader Ditz there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for shift change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.30,0:18:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm opposed to it. If she's a spy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My decision stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the kind of woman who lies and claims we attacked first!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? This isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost your brother, too! You don't really trust Melda, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the main bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Garmillas fighter that was on board has launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.37,0:18:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears to be Melda.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the Falcons launched, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone issue a pursuit order?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:19:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Yamato. Come in, Falcon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, come in, Falcon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's piloting that thing? What do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in! Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just you and me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy lock-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning! Warning! Engine trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship cannot maintain itself in these conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:20:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine pressure rising. Critical in ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Eject! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Akio...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.45,0:20:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato. Melda brought you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Melda did?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.25,0:20:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She's leaving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.34,0:21:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Six days in the brig.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.10,0:21:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.97,0:21:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But I do think I feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye. There's food in here for four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't think I might leave her and escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.37,0:21:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we can trust one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"You have talent."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.01,0:21:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We really do have the same mentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Change course. We're leaving the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.33,0:25:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who come from beyond the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.04,0:25:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Two worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.66,0:25:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth and fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.71,0:25:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Two truths each create their own sense of "right."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.84,0:25:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any hope to be found beyond them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.30,0:25:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato presses forward, across the galactic seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.22,0:25:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: What Lies Beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.89,0:25:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 318 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:37.50,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Believe that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:45.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Only the future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:53.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Has the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:59.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}No one knows
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:14.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Memory only strikes at
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:25.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The heart to find
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:29.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The truth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:37.02,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}Do not forget it…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:45.20,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Many stars lie beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:53.87,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}The spiral of memory
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:24:06.47,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sparkling in what looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.47,0:24:13.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)}The light of memory
