Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.69,0:01:54.59,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<We've created an opening in the enemy lines.>
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.94,0:01:56.40,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Divide the enemy.>
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:58.13,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<The 7th Strike Group is to advance!>
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:01:59.74,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Drive a wedge through them!>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:16.30,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Flatten them!>
